  <id>io.github.sc_software_tools.sc_utility_suite_dist.MediaTrim</id>
  <name>Media Trim</name>
  <summary>Trim video and audio, extract MP3/WAV and convert video</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>LicenseRef-proprietary</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.sc_software_tools"><name>SC Software</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>Trim videos and audio, extract the soundtrack as MP3 or WAV, or convert and shrink videos to 720p.</p>
    <p>Drag the markers on the timeline to choose the part you want; cuts can be made without re-encoding. Processing happens locally with a bundled FFmpeg.</p>
    <p>Free to use; a one-time PRO licence (Gumroad) unlocks batch and advanced features. Files are processed locally.</p>
  </description>
